========================================================= -->
<section  class=" section-white hidden about">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 md:px-8 lg:px-10">
    <div class="reveal mb-10">
      <span class="section-index">01</span>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">About the Conclave</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Social Entrepreneurship Conclave 2026</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="about-lead">
          The <strong>Social Entrepreneurship Conclave 2026</strong> is a platform designed to bring together social entrepreneurs, startups, investors, NGOs, government, academia, communities, and ecosystem partners to foster <strong>collaboration, knowledge exchange, mentorship, market access and partnerships</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="about-quote mt-8">
          <span class="about-quote-mark">"</span>
          <p>
            The conclave aims to strengthen the social entrepreneurship ecosystem in Kerala and to create social startups based on technology or product innovation — empowering social and women enterprises to scale their impact and build home-grown global brands from Kerala.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal" style="animation-delay:.05s">
        <div class="about-copy-block">
          <p class="body-copy">
            The conclave will facilitate knowledge exchange, partnerships, mentor connect, product showcase and market linkages, enabling social enterprises to scale their impact and build home-grown global brands from Kerala.
          </p>
          <div class="about-divider"></div>
          <p class="body-copy">
            The conclave will launch the <strong class="text-ink">Social Entrepreneurship Programme (SEP)</strong>, which is an incubation programme curated for social entrepreneurs by KSUM. This is a 12-week incubation programme that provides EDPs, mentoring, knowledgeable sessions, market access, funding opportunities etc for social startups.
          </p>
          <div class="about-divider"></div>
          <p class="body-copy">
            The event will also witness the launch of the <strong class="text-ink">first women startup cell in Kerala</strong> and the release of the <strong class="text-ink">Women Startup Handbook</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
